OL,3,AMore than 900 killed in Gaza this year
OL,4,Adespite ceasefire, Hamas-run health
OL,5,Aministry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 900 people have been killed
OL,8,Fin Israeli attacks in Gaza this year
OL,9,Fdespite the ceasefire, according to
OL,10,Flatest figures from the territory's
OL,11,FHamas-run Ministry of Health.
OL,13,FIt brings the total number of
OL,14,FPalestinians killed in the Strip since
OL,15,Fthe 10 October ceasefire was declared
OL,16,Fto more than 1,300, including 301
OL,17,Fchildren, the ministry says.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
