OL,3,AMore than 900 killed in Gaza this year
OL,4,Adespite ceasefire, Hamas-run health
OL,5,Aministry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHamas and Israel agreed to halt the war
OL,8,Fafter accepting US President Donald
OL,9,FTrump's 20-point peace plan. That plan
OL,10,Fincluded a suspension of "all military
OL,11,Foperations, including aerial and
OL,12,Fartillery bombardment".
OL,14,FSince then, BBC Verify has analysed
OL,15,Fdozens of videos which show the impact
OL,16,Fof Israeli strikes on locations
OL,17,Fincluding a beachside cafe, tents where
OL,18,Fdisplaced people have been sheltering,
OL,19,Fand a reported funeral procession in
OL,20,Fcentral Gaza.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
